@title Heat-up: the wall and plate mass line fits the Heat strip
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# PR 1859. A Heat-up run in the Cabinet view adds one line to the strip: how long the air takes to reach 90 % of its final rise when walls and plate store heat, marked "model, not measurement". The line must fit at 1366 uncut. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key shift+h
wait 60
click_text Heat-up
wait_s 90
expect "Wall and plate mass"
shot heat-up-strip
move 228 149
wait 30
shot hover-text
check_layout
check_blank hover-text
